new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9890b0b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/INCIDENT.md
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+# Incident: Cart Service Functionality Degraded
+
+## Description
+Users are reporting issues with the cart functionality, including failures when adding items to the cart, viewing cart contents, or performing any other cart-related operations. The service appears to be unresponsive or returning errors for these actions. This is impacting the ability of customers to complete purchases on the Robot Shop application. Metrics show an increase in error rates for the cart service and a decrease in successful cart operations.
